WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.200
Three of four careers pages link away.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.000
So follow the link, and never guess one.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.400
It costs no extra request to find.

4
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.900
And it is read as a stranger's page.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.500
A board cannot win a slot on its own.

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:23.500
So both are read, and the reading decides.

7
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.300
A board announces its list differently.

8
00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.700
And writes it the other way round.

9
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.200
Where the roles actually live.
